432 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 326 0 R
/E (          The Skill Gap Analysis & Personalized Roadmap Generator is a web-based career guidance system developed to help students and job seekers understand their career requirements and identify the skills needed to achieve their desired career goals. Users can create and manage their profiles, provide their educational and skill information, and select their preferred career role. The system uses a career-skill dataset to identify the skills required for the selected career and compares them with the user's existing skills.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
433 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 326 0 R
/E (          Based on this comparison, the system identifies the user's matched skills and missing skills and calculates the skill match percentage. The results are presented in a clear and structured manner through the Skill Gap Analysis and Career Report modules. The system also generates a personalized learning roadmap based on the identified skill gaps, helping users understand which skills they need to develop and follow a suitable learning path. This provides users with a clear understanding of their current skill level and the areas that require improvement.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
434 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 326 0 R
/E (          The system is developed using Python and Flask for backend processing, routing, authentication, skill analysis, roadmap generation, and report generation. HTML and CSS are used to design the user interface, while MySQL is used for storing and managing user and analysis data. By combining career selection, skill gap analysis, personalized roadmap generation, and career reporting in a single system, the proposed application provides a structured approach to career planning and helps users make better decisions about their future skill development.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
