541 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 332 0 R
/E (          The system aims to identify and organize the technical skills currently possessed by the user. These skills are used as input for comparison with the skills required for the selected career. This enables the system to determine the user's current skill profile in relation to the desired career.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
542 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 332 0 R
/E (          The first objective is to develop a centralized platform through which users can manage their career-related information. Instead of depending on multiple sources to understand career requirements, users can access profile management, career selection, skill analysis, roadmap generation, and reporting features through a single application.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
543 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 332 0 R
/E (          The system provides a profile management facility through which users can enter and maintain their relevant information. Details such as personal information, educational qualification, and other career-related information can be maintained in the system. This information provides the basic context required for the career planning process.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
544 0 obj
<<
