/S /H1
/P 339 0 R
/T (           In the existing approach, there is often no single integrated workflow connecting user profile information, career selection, skill analysis, skill matching, missing-skill identification, and personalized roadmap generation. These activities are usually performed separately. The user has to move between different platforms to complete the process.)
/E (           In the existing approach, there is often no single integrated workflow connecting user profile information, career selection, skill analysis, skill matching, missing-skill identification, and personalized roadmap generation. These activities are usually performed separately. The user has to move between different platforms to complete the process.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
628 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 339 0 R
/T (          For example, consider a student who wants to become a Web Developer. The student may first search for the skills required for web development. The student may then prepare a list of technologies such as HTML, CSS, JavaScript, database concepts, and other relevant skills. After that, the student must compare this list with the skills they already know. If the student identifies missing skills, another search is required to find appropriate learning resources. Finally, the student must create a learning sequence manually.)
/E (          For example, consider a student who wants to become a Web Developer. The student may first search for the skills required for web development. The student may then prepare a list of technologies such as HTML, CSS, JavaScript, database concepts, and other relevant skills. After that, the student must compare this list with the skills they already know. If the student identifies missing skills, another search is required to find appropriate learning resources. Finally, the student must create a learning sequence manually.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [1]
>>
