/P 364 0 R
/E (          The Skill Gap Analysis & Personalized Roadmap Generator is implemented as a modular web-based application. The system is divided into several functional modules, where each module performs a specific task within the overall career planning process. The modular approach makes the system easier to develop, test, maintain, and extend.)
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
