1143 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 364 0 R
/E (          These modules are interconnected and follow a sequential workflow. The user first logs into the application, manages their profile, selects a career, and provides their current skill information. The system then performs skill gap analysis and skill matching. Based on the identified missing skills, a personalized roadmap is generated. Finally, the user can view a consolidated career report.)
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
1144 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 364 0 R
/E (          The backend of the system is implemented using Python and Flask, while MySQL is used for database management. HTML and CSS are used to develop the user interface. The career-skill dataset provides the required skill information associated with different career roles.)
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
