<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 382 0 R
/E (          System testing is an important stage in the development of the Skill Gap Analysis & Personalized Roadmap Generator. Testing is performed to verify that the developed application works according to the specified requirements and that the different modules function correctly both individually and as part of the complete system. The main purpose of testing is to identify errors, incorrect inputs, navigation problems, database issues, and unexpected system behavior before the application is used by end users.)
/Pg 68 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1471 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 382 0 R
/E (          The project consists of several interconnected modules such as User Login, Profile Management, Career Selection, Skill Gap Analysis, Skill Matching, Personalized Roadmap, and Career Report. Since the output of one module is used as input for another module, proper testing is necessary to ensure that information is transferred correctly throughout the application.)
/Pg 68 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1472 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 382 0 R
/E (          The first objective of testing is to verify the functional correctness of the application. Each feature must perform the operation for which it was designed. For example, the Login module must authenticate valid users and reject invalid login credentials. Similarly, the Profile Management module must store the user's profile information correctly, while the Career Selection module must save the selected career preference.)
/Pg 68 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1473 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 382 0 R
/E (          Another important objective is to verify the accuracy of skill analysis. The system compares the user's current skills with the skills required for the selected career. Testing ensures that matched skills and missing skills are identified correctly. The calculated skill matching percentage must also be generated based on the available skill information.)
/Pg 68 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1474 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 382 0 R
/E (          Testing also verifies the functionality of the Personalized Roadmap Module. The roadmap should be generated according to the user's identified skill gaps rather than displaying unrelated learning topics. The system should correctly identify the skills that need improvement and present appropriate learning steps.)
/Pg 68 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
