/T (          The modular structure of the system also makes the application easier to understand and maintain. Each major function is implemented as a separate module, while the modules are connected through the application's workflow. Authentication controls access to the system, profile information provides user-specific details, career selection determines the analysis context, skill analysis identifies gaps, the roadmap provides learning direction, and the report summarizes the results.)
/E (          The modular structure of the system also makes the application easier to understand and maintain. Each major function is implemented as a separate module, while the modules are connected through the application's workflow. Authentication controls access to the system, profile information provides user-specific details, career selection determines the analysis context, skill analysis identifies gaps, the roadmap provides learning direction, and the report summarizes the results.)
/Pg 83 0 R
/K [0]
>>
