/Title (One of the important features of the proposed system is the Personalized Roadmap Generator. The roadmap is generated according to the user's selected career and identified skill gaps. The system focuses on missing skills rather than providing a generic learning sequence. Each roadmap item can provide access to external learning resources related to the particular skill. This approach allows users to follow a more focused learning path based on their individual requirements.)
